config NE_CPU256
        bool "CPU256"
        default n
        ---help---
          If turn on this flag L3QM CPU256 will be supported. 

config NE_PHY_CALIBRATION
        bool "PHY calibration"
        default n
        ---help---
          BJ4

config NE_MANAGEMENT_MODE
        bool "NI management mode"
        default n
        ---help---
          BJ4

config NE_AUTO_TEST_MODE
        bool "NI auto test mode"
        default n
        ---help---
          It use to forward the test packet between analyte board and Auto Test Tool.
          Auto test tool need to connect on RGMII port.
          1. Remove the pseudo header from RGMII port(and src/dst port=9877),
                     then forward real data to target port.
          2. Add the pseudo header from other port0 - port4,
                     then forward data to RGMII port.

config NE_TX_LLID_MAP
        bool "NI TX do LLID map with source IP"
        default n
        ---help---
          Cortina API will provide LLID map to source IP
          in ca_ni_start_xmit() will look up the map table
          and get the llid from source IP and transmit it
          in pol_id of Header A

config NE_PTP_CLOCK
        bool "NI PTP Clock support"
        default n
        ---help---
          This driver adds support for using the Cortina SoC as a PTP
          clock. This clock is only useful if your PTP programs are
          getting hardware time stamps on the PTP Ethernet packets
          using the Linux SO_TIMESTAMPING API.

          This requires to enable Linux option CONFIG_PTP_1588_CLOCK.
